itle":"秋思十首 其六","author":"陆游","text":"看云庐阜屏风叠，采药嵩山冠子峰。\n行尽四方心未快，不如一棹醉吴松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5661,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋思十首 其八","author":"陆游","text":"闲愁正可资诗酒，小疾安能减食眠。\n一亩旋租畦菜地，千钱新买钓鱼船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5662,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋思三首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"水际柴门一扇开，白头羸病亦堪哀。\n阿谁得似桄榔杖，肯为闲人万里来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5663,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋思十首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"露浓压架葡萄熟，日嫩登场䆉稏香。\n商略人生如意事，及身强健得还乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5664,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋思十首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"三三两两戏鱼行，香饵才投去若惊。\n寄与扁舟五湖客，只当远引过平生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5665,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋思十首 其七","author":"陆游","text":"傍县人来涕泗翻，蝗灾暴虎不堪言。\n天心似为衰翁地，饱食安眠独北村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5666,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋思十首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"秋云易簇日常阴，西望山村每欲寻。\n屏掩数峰临峭绝，蛇蟠一径入幽深。",