uthor":"陆游","text":"老病侵凌不可当，时时揽镜自悲伤。\n西风吹散朝来酒，依旧衰颜似叶黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5692,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋晚杂兴十二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"汀树犹青未著霜，垄间稗穗已先黄。\n放翁皓首归民籍，烂醉狂歌坐箦床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5693,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋晚杂兴十二首 其九","author":"陆游","text":"禹巡吾国三千岁，陈迹销沉渺莽中。\n岂独江山无定主，苔矶知换几渔翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5694,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋晚杂兴十二首 其十","author":"陆游","text":"江东谁复识重瞳，遗庙攲斜草棘中。\n若比咿嘤念如意，乌江战死尚英雄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5695,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋晚杂兴十二首 其十二","author":"陆游","text":"渺渺风烟接小江，牛头山色满蓬窗。\n门前西走钱塘路，也有闲人似老庞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5696,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋晚思梁益旧游三首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"幅巾筇杖立篱门，秋意萧条欲断魂。\n恰似嘉陵江上路，冷云微雨湿黄昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5697,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋晚思梁益旧游三首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"忆昔西行万里馀，长亭夜夜梦归吴。\n如今历尽风波恶，飞栈连云是